      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can’t think of another platform that does this.\n\nNot only do you change all the text, but when making announcements and posts via the website, the website claims to show you a preview of the post. But it’s not a preview of the final sanitized text. So it’s not a preview of anything, it’s just a duplication of what you see in the text box that you typed in.\n\nYou preview something when it is rendered differently than the input.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
